generation_mode.description:
The type of generation (determines whether input images are involved).
This is a tagged enum, so it looks like:
  "generation_mode": {"type": "text_to_image"}
  "generation_mode": {"type": "image_edit", "count": 2}

The type of generation (determines how many input images are involved).
This is a tagged enum, so it looks like:
  "generation_mode": {"type": "text_to_video"}
  "generation_mode": {"type": "reference_image_to_video", "count": 1}

reference_image_media_tokens.description:
Reference images (optional).
NOTE: Spherical/panorama coordinates are not yet supported per-image;
multiple images are treated as multi-view input of the same world.
